tv: session-generation guard closes stale cross-session hydration writes (reveal boundary)

Bump a session generation at the start of connect/enroll/switchProfile/
relock; every home-loading flow (incl. reveal) captures it and re-checks
after each await before mutating published state, so an outgoing revealed
profile's late hydration can never merge restricted items into the next
profile's locked homeState (ADR-0004). Per-flow taskID guards for
search/openEntity/preparePlayback are unchanged.

